{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Keep terminal waiters blocked until the change hook settles.** Terminal operation futures are completed before this aggregated `onOperationChange` call. A resumed handler can start a follow-up at-least-once step while the hook is blocked; if it then reports a fatal error, that step's uncheckpointed side effect may repeat on replay. Publish the checkpoint state, dispatch `onOperationChange`, and only then complete terminal operation futures. Add a blocked-hook/follow-up-step replay regression.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc75yySL","finding_digest":"2ec144e6d7922e9aa3a8e7041782be2f4faa8c07697c1c489710a29503fe727c","finding_id":"arf_v1_f3aujzwxsixjvi5i44cbpav6f5","finding_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::oncheckpointcomplete::operation-change-fatal-after-waiter-release","identity_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::oncheckpointcomplete::operation-change-fatal-after-waiter-release","line":278,"observation_digest":"38fb947351991506a73c9ea046f9b74336c7e9b02ec00132a6fe8de2e76358ad","observation_id":"aro_v1_hd5zi42rtekqnjz4t2qen6nxim","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ExecutionManager.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_f3aujzwxsixjvi5i44cbpav6f5","published_at":"2026-10-06T02:10:45Z","review_id":"arr_v1_srpzztcmp5i2mmjiox5whsqbht","reviewed_base_sha":"ac6a6f5ea50d6a9098b716905f01c609e4c201ae","reviewed_head_sha":"1114742a5845c8ef7b93371daa0eea99e13e9ba8","reviewer":"codex","start_line":278,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_4irfz5ppmvujogt5ek4qsoxkuw","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-06T02:10:45Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
